From 453646f0b134dcbe260c232082a0865650e2172e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Developer <developer@example.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 07:59:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(deer-flow): add pacgate-mcp so the agent can query
 legal databases

Add a FastMCP HTTP server (deploy/pacgate-mcp) exposing pacgate_kb_search,
pacgate_connector_search and pacgate_list_connectors, backed by pacgate-api's
/api/kb/search, /api/search and /api/search/connectors. Register it besides
openviking in deer-flow-extensions-config, add a pacgate-mcp service to
compose.prod.yaml, and pass PACGATE_MATTER_ID + API credentials to deer-flow
so the memory adapter stops falling back to local file storage.

Also switch the deer-flow model list to on-board Ollama models (ornith-1.5:9b
default) since ollama.com is unreachable on the AIPC.
